        "cooked": "<aside class=\"quote no-group\" data-username=\"Craig\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n<img loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/craig/48/2150_2.png\" class=\"avatar\"> Craig:</div>\n<blockquote>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<div><b>Belle Sorciere wrote:</b><br><blockquote><strong>Belle Sorciere wrote:</strong><br><blockquote>&nbsp;Paul wrote:<br><blockquote>@BelleThanks I'm glad that will help!If you are still interested in backing Fate of the Elder Gods, there are actually preorders available now through <a href=\"https://fate-of-the-elder-gods-the-boardgame-of-lovecrafti.backerkit.com/hosted_preorders\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\">BackerKit</a>!&nbsp;\n&nbsp;\n</blockquote></blockquote>\nThanks!How long will it be available? I'm not sure I can afford it this month (but there's a possibility I can, so who knows? Not me).Wait - when does Backerkit actually take the money? Right away or when it's time to ship?Could I get an answer to this?\n</blockquote></div>\nI don't currently know when, exactly, the BackerKit for Fate of the Elder Gods will be locked down, but you've at least got another couple of months. Your card won't be charged right away, but it will be charged when everything gets locked down. That's usually six to eight weeks before things ship, unless weird things happen.\n</blockquote>\n</aside>\n<p><br>Thank you much, Craig. Hopefully I can swing it then. <img src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/images/emoji/apple/slight_smile.png?v=12\" title=\":slight_smile:\" class=\"emoji\" alt=\":slight_smile:\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\"></p>",
